      "purpose": "Defines Flow type definitions and bitmask constants for React Fiber's Offscreen and LegacyHidden components, specifying props, state, queue, instance shapes, and visibility flags used by the reconciler.",
      "summary": "This module is part of the React Fiber reconciler and provides Flow type declarations for the Offscreen component system. It defines the LegacyHiddenProps and OffscreenProps shapes, the OffscreenState containing base lanes and cache pool, the OffscreenQueue for transitions and tracing markers, and the OffscreenInstance holding a visibility bitmask and pending markers. It also exports numeric bitmask constants OffscreenVisible and OffscreenPassiveEffectsConnected to track component visibility and effect connection state. No runtime logic is implemented; it serves as a shared schema for offscreen rendering internals.",
